# Input
```ts
/* should generate diagnostics */
(x as number) === y || (x as number) < y;
x! === y || x! < y;
(x satisfies number) === y || (x satisfies number) < y;
(<number>x) === y || x < y;
x === y as number || x < y;
x === "a" satisfies string || x < "a";

```

